   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENHANCING REFUGEE RESPONSE FRAMEWORK</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project focuses on protection and support for vulnerable refugee and stateless populations through GBV prevention and response, child protection, refugee registration, and statelessness advocacy. The intervention promotes equitable access to protection services, legal documentation, psychosocial support, and community-based protection systems.While disability inclusion is not explicitly mentioned, the programme&#x2019;s strong protection and inclusion focus provides opportunities to integrate disability-responsive approaches within service delivery and access mechanisms. Therefore, the programme aligns with Score 1 &#x2013; Significant Objective.</narrative>
  </description>
